      "dc:source": "c2014c00762.pdf, p.5",
      "values:originalText": "This Act may be cited as the Australian Broadcasting Corporation\n(Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments) Act\n1983.",
      "skos:definition": "This Act may be cited as the Australian Broadcasting Corporation\n(Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments) Act\n1983.",
      "cml:asserts": [
