      "dc:source": "c2014c00762.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "Expressions used in this Part have, unless the contrary intention\nappears, the same meanings as those expressions have in the\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983.",
      "skos:definition": "Expressions used in this Part have, unless the contrary intention\nappears, the same meanings as those expressions have in the\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983.",
