    {
      "@id": "concept:c2014c00762-sec-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 Members of Commission cease to hold office",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2014c00762#sec-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2014c00762.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2014c00762.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "On the commencing day, the Chairman, the Vice-Chairman and the\nother Commissioners of the Australian Broadcasting Commission\nwho held office immediately before that day cease to hold office,\nbut the corporate identity of the body corporate referred to in\nsubsection 5(1) of the Australian Broadcasting Corporation Act\n1983 is preserved.\n7  References to Commission in instruments, &c.\n\nA reference to the Australian Broadcasting Commission in any law\nof a Territory, or in any contract, award or other instrument to\nwhich the Australian Broadcasting Commission was a party, shall,\nexcept in relation to matters that occurred before the commencing\nday, be construed as a reference to the Australian Broadcasting\nCorporation.\n\n\nTransitional Provisions  Part II\n\nSection 8\n\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation (Transitional Provisions and\nConsequential Amendments) Act 1983",
      "skos:definition": "On the commencing day, the Chairman, the Vice-Chairman and the\nother Commissioners of the Australian Broadcasting Commission\nwho held office immediately before that day cease to hold office,\nbut the corporate identity of the body corporate referred to in\nsubsection 5(1) of the Australian Broadcasting Corporation Act\n1983 is preserved.\n7  References to Commission in instruments, &c.\n\nA reference to the Australian Broadcasting Commission in any law\nof a Territory, or in any contract, award or other instrument to\nwhich the Australian Broadcasting Commission was a party, shall,\nexcept in relation to matters that occurred before the commencing\nday, be construed as a reference to the Australian Broadcasting\nCorporation.\n\n\nTransitional Provisions  Part II\n\nSection 8\n\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation (Transitional Provisions and\nConsequential Amendments) Act 1983",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2014c00762-sec-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2014c00762-sec-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2014c00762-sec-6-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2014c00762-sec-6-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2014c00762-sec-6-logic-diffusion-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7c7847fd0e006f787f6a58ca7774e769f3b40e3192676659c03b85469e575b48",
      "skos:note": "Members of Commission cease to hold office on commencing day."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2014c00762#sec-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Members of Commission cease to hold office",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "On the commencing day, the Chairman, the Vice-Chairman and the\nother Commissioners of the Australian Broadcasting Commission\nwho held office immediately before that day cease to hold office,\nbut the corporate identity of the body corporate referred to in\nsubsection 5(1) of the Australian Broadcasting Corporation Act\n1983 is preserved.\n7  References to Commission in instruments, &c.\n\nA reference to the Australian Broadcasting Commission in any law\nof a Territory, or in any contract, award or other instrument to\nwhich the Australian Broadcasting Commission was a party, shall,\nexcept in relation to matters that occurred before the commencing\nday, be construed as a reference to the Australian Broadcasting\nCorporation.\n\n\nTransitional Provisions  Part II\n\nSection 8\n\nAustralian Broadcasting Corporation (Transitional Provisions and\nConsequential Amendments) Act 1983"
    },
    {
